{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EquatableView"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SQ","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Equatable"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/View","preciseIdentifier":"s:10TUIkitView0B0P","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When TUIKit renders an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EquatableView"},{"text":", it compares the current content with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the previously cached value. If the content is unchanged ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"and","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the available","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"size hasn’t changed, the cached ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FrameBuffer"},{"text":" is returned immediately —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"skipping the entire subtree rendering.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Usage","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Usage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apply "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".equatable()"},{"type":"text","text":" to any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Equatable"},{"type":"text","text":" view:"}]},{"code":["struct ScoreDisplay: View, Equatable {","    let name: String","    let score: Int","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            Text(name)","            Text(\"Score: \\(score)\")","        }","    }","}","","\/\/ In a parent view:","ScoreDisplay(name: \"Player 1\", score: 42).equatable()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"score","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are unchanged between frames, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and both","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Text","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" views are never re-rendered — the cached buffer is returned directly.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"When-to-Use","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"When to Use"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Large static subtrees"}]},{"text":" — views with many children that rarely change","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Expensive rendering","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — views whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"renderToBuffer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is costly","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animation siblings"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — static views next to animated ones","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"When-NOT-to-Use","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"When NOT to Use"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Views that read "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" directly (state lives in a reference-type box,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text",